# Probability cycles count from 1 again when a part changes pattern, the 909 too: a 909 kick on step 1 at
# 1:4 in pattern 1, copied to pattern 2; six bars of P1 (kicks on bars 1 and 5), then P2 from bar 7: its
# first pass, so a kick there. Through bar 8: 3 kicks (the 909 kept counting before: 2).
wait 300
tapkey b0
tapkey w0
key w0 down
turn SELECT -25
key w0 up
expect laneval7.0.0.0 106
press SAVE
tapkey w1
release SAVE
tap GLO
turn SELECT 1
turn ALGO 1
tap HOME
tap HOME
expect view 0
tap PLAY
wait 10000
tapkey w1
wait 5000
tap PLAY
expect ppat0 2
expect noteons 3
